# Display name 
Name your script whatever you like; this does not rename the files (it only affects how they are displayed in the app)

# Local Version 
Overwrites the version found by the application
(Make sure you select the correct version you have)

# Associated ini path / Name
name_of_your_ini.ini
or
Script'name Folder\name_of_your_ini'script.ini

# Mod page URL
-github :https://github.com/user/script/releases
-gta5-mods.com : simply script URL 
-LSPDFR :simply script url (you need api-key in the preferences) Update v.1.1.5


# Personal notes
Everything you want to write :) 

